sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(orchestrator + reasoning)
    participant Eng as Engineered Drill / Scenario<br/>(deterministic, reproducible)
    participant Target as Target Network

    Note over Operator,Target: Future work: seamless switch between<br/>engineered execution and agentic reasoning

    Operator->>Agent: goal (e.g. assess and harden the network)
    activate Agent

    loop per attack-chain step (recon, enumeration, credential access, ...)
        Note over Agent,Target: implemented part: deterministic step
        Agent->>Eng: run the next engineered drill
        activate Eng
        Eng->>Target: execute (scan / check / exploit)
        Target-->>Eng: raw result
        Eng-->>Agent: structured result (reproducible)
        deactivate Eng

        Note over Agent: agent part: reason over result,<br/>assess and propose next step

        Note over Operator,Agent: human interaction
        Agent->>Operator: present findings + proposed next step
        Operator-->>Agent: approve / adjust / stop
    end

    Agent-->>Operator: final attack-chain report<br/>(findings, severity, remediation)
    deactivate Agent
